WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500
Hi guys.

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.890
I will cut right to the point:

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:05.400
I am taking a hiatus for about a month

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:10.040
and the reason is I'm not very happy with the videos that I've been making.

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:12.560
And it's not that I'm burnt out on making videos.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:13.820
I- totally the opposite.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.460
I'm actually more eager than I ever have been

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:19.260
to make videos and that's kind of part of the problem.

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:20.620
I love making videos.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:23.420
I-I-I-I'm more than happy to work non-stop

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:25.160
on something that I'm proud of.

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:28.280
I'm a workaholic. I'll work every day, bro.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:30.860
I don't take weekends, I don't take vacations.

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:32.640
and I know this may sound strange to you guys

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:34.760
because like the schedule is super wonky

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:37.589
so if I'm working non-stop then why are videos so inconsistent?

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:40.559
I'm basically completely absent from social media

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:44.480
And in a weird way it could seem like I'm doing nothing at all,

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:46.740
when in fact I'm trying to do more than ever

00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:48.600
at making the videos better

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:51.280
or making me more satisfied with the videos that I'm doing.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:53.500
But without a way to exceed my own expectations

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:56.520
in what I'm doing and what I'm posting in the videos that I'm making,

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:58.620
I don't feel like I'm ever improving.

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:00.020
So then on and on it goes

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:02.380
that I keep adding more and more effort into what I do

00:01:02.399 --> 00:01:04.588
and then it's this cyclical thing where I go,

00:01:04.588 --> 00:01:08.200
"oh, it's not enough" or "oh, I need to work harder at this"

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:11.640
or "I need to work better this or improve this one thing".

00:01:11.710 --> 00:01:15.119
And yet, this kind of cycle has been going on for about a year now

00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:18.940
where I continually am unhappy with the videos that I make.

00:01:18.940 --> 00:01:23.020
I try to solve the problem with brute force effort

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:25.400
rather than creativity.

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:27.760
In the end, I just don't want to settle

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:31.080
on the videos that I'm really proud of and really excited for

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:32.220
and really happy with.

00:01:32.220 --> 00:01:34.620
And the videos that make me laugh that I make,

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:38.000
I don't want those to be the exception to the rule.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:39.780
I want those to be the rule.

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:42.240
Now this doesn't mean that I'm going to be disappearing.

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:44.800
A hiatus doesn't mean that I'm taking a vacation.

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:46.640
I just told you I don't do that.

00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:50.040
I'm actually gonna be filming and planning and writing

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:53.300
and collaborating every single day leading up to this.

00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:58.320
And it also doesn't mean that I'm going to be completely vacant on content.

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:01.380
Like I'm probably gonna be more active

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:04.400
on social media than ever over these next few weeks,

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:07.020
just because I will be goofing with you guys.

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:08.000
I'll be talking with you guys,

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:09.740
I will be trying to get feedback from you guys,

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:12.760
I will be like in tune with the community again,

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:14.560
which is something that I very much miss.

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:18.080
And also there will still be content during this time,

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:20.300
not a lot, but there will still be content.

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:23.540
We have our charity live stream on the 30th of November we're doing,

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:26.520
we still have the big project that is coming out,

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:29.340
and I will tell you a release date just to give you something to look forward to;

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:33.040
that is coming out Friday the 13th of October,

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:34.620
and it's gonna be pretty cool.

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:35.680
So you can look forward to that.

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:38.020
And, obviously, we're still doing the tour.

00:02:38.020 --> 00:02:40.020
Like the tour is definitely still happening

00:02:40.020 --> 00:02:41.010
and I can't wait to do that.

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:43.529
I can't wait to be performing for you guys with my friends

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:46.020
and even then we're gonna be out there

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:47.730
and we're gonna be filming cool stuff while we're doing it

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:50.440
and I'm gonna be talking with Bob and Wade and Tyler and Ethan.

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:52.679
I'm gonna be talking with all those guys about

00:02:53.410 --> 00:02:55.889
like what videos can really like

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:58.740
really make me passionate about it,  you know.

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:00.800
What videos can I really burn for it?

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:04.720
What videos can I really like really strive to improve upon?

00:03:04.720 --> 00:03:06.840
And what videos can I like surprise you guys?

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:10.380
'Cause I know I can make really cool stuff.

00:03:10.380 --> 00:03:13.060
It's just that you know my focus

00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:15.940
hasn't been able to be 100% dedicated.

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:18.000
Like I'm an obsessive person.

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:19.960
I want to go to bed with a smile on my face

00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:25.920
knowing that what I made is something that people can remember,

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:29.080
something that people will cherish,

00:03:29.380 --> 00:03:31.520
something that -I'll- cherish you know.

00:03:32.050 --> 00:03:33.480
And that's what's important.

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:35.969
So anyway, to recap: I'm going on hiatus.

00:03:35.970 --> 00:03:39.960
I'll be back. October 23rd is when I'm aiming to go back.

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:42.240
That is the date, set in stone.

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:44.060
So you guys can count on

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:48.260
seeing the new stuff starting to roll out on the 23rd of October.

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:51.920
And still doing the charity live stream,

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:54.620
still doing the big projects, still doing the tour.

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:56.860
And it should be a lot of fun.

00:03:56.860 --> 00:03:59.220
So thank you guys so much for understanding.

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:00.380
If you are upset about this,

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:03.000
please record yourself screaming and panicking in the streets

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:05.020
and post it all over social media

00:04:05.020 --> 00:04:07.580
as is the usual Markiplier crisis response.

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:10.420
So thank you all so much for watching

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:13.680
and it may take a bit, but I promise...

00:04:13.740 --> 00:04:15.360
wink wonk...

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:18.100
I will see you in the next video.

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:21.000
Buh-bye

